@sentence
@lu Ech maache mäi Bett all Moien.
@en I make my bed every morning.
@distractor-lu Dësch
@distractor-lu owes
@distractor-en table
@distractor-en evening

@sentence
@lu Meng Fra an ech deelen eis de Stot.
@en My wife and I share the household chores.
@distractor-lu Gaart
@distractor-lu Dreck
@distractor-en garden
@distractor-en dirt

@sentence
@lu Ech raumen d'Spullmaschinn all Owend an.
@en I load the dishwasher every evening.
@distractor-lu ausraumen
@distractor-lu moies
@distractor-en unload
@distractor-en morning

@sentence
