@sentence
@lu Eng stëbseg Wunneng ass de Géigendeel vu propper.
@en A dusty apartment is the opposite of clean.
@distractor-lu frësch
@distractor-lu Freed
@distractor-en fresh
@distractor-en joy

@sentence
@lu Strecken ass fir mech ermiddend an onpraktesch.
